{
  "_readme": [
    "COST TABLE — the single source of truth for catalogue pricing.",
    "Every product in products.json is a list of component keys. Its selling",
    "price is computed as: sum(component cost) x margin, rounded.",
    "",
    "IMPORTANT: these costs are DRAFT market estimates, not your books.",
    "Replace each `cost` with what you actually pay, then re-run:",
    "    node scripts/build-catalog.mjs",
    "and every product reprices itself. Nothing else needs editing.",
    "",
    "`cost` = your cost to deliver one unit (materials + labour share).",
    "`label` = the line the customer sees in the Inclusions list."
